{"id":"wb-7-732","name":"天宁寺前殿","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"天宁寺 (邢台市)","text":"天宁寺，又名华池兰若，俗称西大寺或西寺是始建于唐代，后毁于战火，又于元代重建的汉传佛教寺院，现仅存前殿。天宁寺位于中国河北省邢台市市内。2013年3月，天宁寺前殿被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n位于邢州古城西侧的天宁寺和位于邢州东侧的开元寺（俗称东大寺）同处一条东西轴线上，两寺相对。天宁寺是邢台市现存最早的木结构建筑，也是邢台市内唯一的金顶琉璃瓦建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E5%AE%81%E5%AF%BA_(%E9%82%A2%E5%8F%B0%E5%B8%82)","revisionId":94910767,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94910767","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6c052cbc8fa9354d516e9f44.jpg","title":"邢台市的天宁寺.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%82%A2%E5%8F%B0%E5%B8%82%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A9%E5%AE%81%E5%AF%BA.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ea/%E9%82%A2%E5%8F%B0%E5%B8%82%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A9%E5%AE%81%E5%AF%BA.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​邢台市的天宁寺","width":320,"height":240}}